wDOBC3Cis5kLjSE","user":{"login":"fullyherge","id":134703250,"node_id":"U_kgDOCAdokg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134703250?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fullyherge","html_url":"https://github.com/fullyherge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fullyherge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fullyherge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fullyherge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fullyherge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fullyherge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fullyherge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fullyherge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fullyherge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fullyherge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-08-16T14:42:47Z","updated_at":"2023-08-16T14:45:48Z","body":"Getting this behaviour as well. Worked around it for now by having my server action, which is called from within an `onSubmit` on a `<form>`, return the `uri` to redirect to and doing it in the client.\r\n\r\nThis will probably not cover all cases though.\r\n\r\n**Server Action, heavily redacted**\r\n\r\n```tsx\r\n\"use server\";\r\n\r\nexport async function runSearch(...) {\r\n  // [...]\r\n  if (result) {\r\n    // redirect(`/device/cubic/${result.id}`);\r\n    return {\r\n      redirect: true,\r\n      redirectUri: `/device/cubic/${result.id}`,\r\n      result: [],\r\n      error: null,\r\n    };\r\n  }\r\n  // [...]\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Form submit**\r\n\r\n```tsx\r\n\"use client\";\r\n\r\n<form\r\n  onSubmit={(e) => {\r\n    e.preventDefault();\r\n    setError(null);\r\n    startTransition(async () => {\r\n      try {\r\n        const result = await runSearch(query, activeCategory);\r\n        if (result?.redirect && result.redirectUri) {\r\n          return router.push(result.redirectUri);\r\n        }\r\n        if (result?.result) {\r\n          setResults(result?.result);\r\n        }\r\n      } catch (error) {\r\n        setError(error as { status: number; message: string });\r\n      }\r\n    });\r\n  }}\r\n>\r\n```","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/1680749700/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"fullyherge","id":134703250,"node_id":"U_kgDOCAdokg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134703250?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fullyherge","html_url":"https://github.com/fullyherge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fullyherge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fullyherge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fullyherge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fullyherge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fullyherge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fullyherge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fullyherge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fullyherge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fullyherge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":10161576451,"node_id":"AE_lADOBC3Cis5uFjfhzwAAAAJdrVoD","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/events/10161576451","actor":{"login":"shuding","id":3676859,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NzY4NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3676859?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shuding","html_url":"https://github.com/shuding","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shuding/followers","following_